This module is used by {{tl|Reply to}} to trigger a [[Special:Notifications|notification]] to one or several registered user(s) you are replying to in a discussion.

==Usage from wikitext==
This module cannot be used directly from wikitext. Please use the {{tl|Reply to}} template instead.

==Usage within templates==
 <nowiki>{{#invoke:@|replyto|<noinclude></nowiki>example=''example name''<nowiki></noinclude></nowiki>|max=''maximum number of names''}}